<title>AUSTRALIA: Carrington to build Australia cotton gin.</title>
<headline>Carrington to build Australia cotton gin.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carrington Cotton Corp Ltd said on Tuesday said it has finalised negotiations to build a A$12 million cotton gin in Queensland near the town of Goondiwindi.</p>
<p>The gin would complement and enhance the company's existing operations, Carrington said.</p>
<p>It would process the company's own crop and act as a commercial gin for other growers, Carrington said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
